{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00332",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 7.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Right, um, hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.18,
      "end_seconds": 13.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.74,
      "end_seconds": 22.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling hot and sweaty before it, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.34,
      "end_seconds": 31.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.19,
      "end_seconds": 39.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "About... well, about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.39,
      "end_seconds": 43.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Mm-hm. How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.46,
      "end_seconds": 45.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.2,
      "end_seconds": 50.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you been passing out once last week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.74,
      "end_seconds": 66.43,
      "duration_seconds": 14.69,
      "text": "Yeah, um, that too. With passing out once last week, about a five out of ten. Well, uh, there's a bit of lightheadedness since then as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.81,
      "end_seconds": 77.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Okay, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.5,
      "end_seconds": 87.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "Okay, so I'd give it a four, out of ten. It sort of comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.31,
      "end_seconds": 93.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.07,
      "end_seconds": 98.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, pollen. I get a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.28,
      "end_seconds": 121.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "What's your current medication list? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.65,
      "end_seconds": 129.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Yeah, um, it's telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.75,
      "end_seconds": 133.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any surgery in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.49,
      "end_seconds": 150.88,
      "duration_seconds": 15.39,
      "text": "Yes, I had a knee arthroscopy, three years ago. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.38,
      "end_seconds": 168.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.41,
      "end_seconds": 177.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.03,
      "end_seconds": 181.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Okay, who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.58,
      "end_seconds": 188.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.77,
      "end_seconds": 191.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Do you exercise at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.92,
      "end_seconds": 199.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.16,
      "end_seconds": 206.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.2,
      "end_seconds": 210.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.04,
      "end_seconds": 220.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Alright, high blood pressure, that matches what I have here. So, does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.25,
      "end_seconds": 224.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Oh, my brother has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.9,
      "end_seconds": 230.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "And what about tongue biting, palpitations or shaking or jerking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.64,
      "end_seconds": 238.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Oh, no, no tongue biting, palpitations or shaking or jerking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.83,
      "end_seconds": 242.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Did you notice any confusion afterwards?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.29,
      "end_seconds": 247.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Well, no, none, no confusion afterwards."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.1,
      "end_seconds": 252.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Alright, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.92,
      "end_seconds": 255.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.3,
      "end_seconds": 259.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.16,
      "end_seconds": 263.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No, um, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.98,
      "end_seconds": 267.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.49,
      "end_seconds": 281.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.69,
      "end_seconds": 313.31,
      "duration_seconds": 12.62,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, temperature is 36.7 degrees. And oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 76 beats a minute, blood pressure 128 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.6,
      "end_seconds": 316.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.77,
      "end_seconds": 320.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "I'll explain what that means shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.74,
      "end_seconds": 325.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let's do the physical part now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.91,
      "end_seconds": 329.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Let me look at this properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.75,
      "end_seconds": 353.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Your pulse is regular and there's a small bruise on the right side of the head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.2,
      "end_seconds": 356.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.68,
      "end_seconds": 375.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No murmurs on listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.89,
      "end_seconds": 377.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.18,
      "end_seconds": 386.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Alright, all done, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.32,
      "end_seconds": 400.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it fits best with a simple faint, probably reflex-related."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.83,
      "end_seconds": 407.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.3,
      "end_seconds": 434.06,
      "duration_seconds": 25.76,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a simple faint, probably reflex-related is my leading thought, not anything worse. We should do an echocardiogram for syncope. I want blood tests done, that's for syncope. Drink enough water and avoid standing still for long stretches, and sit if you feel it coming. Let's plan a check in two weeks. Right, that's all. Go gently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.94,
      "end_seconds": 440.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "One thing: no, um, actually that's all. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.16,
      "end_seconds": 442.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}